# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Conic-Vortex — optional build-time environment variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# None are required. Everything runs from sensible defaults. The variables
# below exist only to customize deployment output.

# Public base path the built site is served under. Leave unset for a root
# deploy (`/`) and local development. For a GitHub Pages *project* site set the
# repository name, e.g.:
#   VITE_BASE=/Conic-Vortex/
# The GitHub Actions Pages workflow sets this automatically.
VITE_BASE=/
